  "description": "Detective Hideoki Takakura’s life descends into chaos when he accidentally shatters the dimensional gate between Raga (the body) and Jiwa (the soul), unleashing a collision of devils, spirits, gods, and humans. As reality begins to unravel, Hideoki must race against time to restore balance—while facing the rise of the supreme god, ready to grant a wish powerful enough to cost him his life. Haunted by existential questions, Hideoki uncovers a second personality within him—one that’s growing stronger, threatening to seize control of his mind. To survive, he must navigate a treacherous world where every choice could lead to redemption… or total ruin.\n\n_Source: Voyce_",
